     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\">\r\nHi Ben,\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>If the copy number is proportional to the read depth coverage and if the noise structure is low-dimensional and is shared across samples, then yes you can give CODEX/CODEX2 a try. I remember seeing studies using DNA methylation data to call CNV\r\n although I have never tried myself and am not sure how sensitive and accurate the calling would be.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Hope this helps,</div>\r\n<div>Yuchao<br>\r\n<div><br>\r\n<blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n<div>On Jul 13, 2018, at 10:54 AM, SOUTHGATE Ben &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">s157...@sms.ed.ac.uk</a>&gt; wrote:</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols;font-size:16px\">\r\n</p>\r\n<div>Dear Yuchao Jiang</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>I was wondering if the approaches you use in CODEX/CODEX2, such as your novel CODEX normalisation and your Poisson-likelihood segmentation algorithm, could also be used for RRBS (Reduced Representation Bisulfite Sequencing) data - where reads\r\n only cover DNA fragments between CCGG......CCGG sites? I note that you state that CODEX2 can be used for WES and targeted sequencing, as well as WGS, so I was wondering if it might have a wider application for this sort of sparser and lower coverage approach.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Kind regards,</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Ben</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols;font-size:16px\">\r\n</p>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols;font-size:16px;color:rgb(33,33,33)\">\r\n<font face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><font face=\"Calibri,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif,Helvetica,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" size=\"3\" color=\"#757B80\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">--------------------------------------------------</span></font><font face=\"Calibri,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif,Helvetica,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><br>\r\n</span></font></span></font></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols;font-size:16px;color:rgb(33,33,33)\">\r\n<font face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><font face=\"Calibri,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif,Helvetica,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" size=\"3\" color=\"#006FC9\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">Dr\r\n Benjamin Southgate </span></font></span></font></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols;font-size:16px;color:rgb(33,33,33)\">\r\n<font face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><font face=\"Calibri,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif,Helvetica,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" size=\"3\" color=\"#757B80\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">Pollard\r\n Lab, </span></font><font face=\"Calibri,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif,Helvetica,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" size=\"3\" color=\"#757B80\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">MRC\r\n Centre for Regenerative Medicine </span></font><br>\r\n</span></font></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols;font-size:16px;color:rgb(33,33,33)\">\r\n<font face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><font face=\"Calibri,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif,Helvetica,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" size=\"3\" color=\"#757B80\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">The\r\n University of Edinburgh</span></font><font face=\"Calibri,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif,Helvetica,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><br>\r\n</span></font></span></font></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols;font-size:16px;color:rgb(33,33,33)\">\r\n<font face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">\r\n<div><font face=\"Calibri,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif,Helvetica,Emo